SUMMARY:STELLA HEATH- Billie Holiday to Edith Piaf- Special Saturday Sunset Series Show
DESCRIPTION:STELLA HEATH- Billie Holiday to Edith Piaf ~  Special Saturday Sunset Series\n​Heath\, who’s earned a devoted following with her lustrous voice\, supple sense of swing\, and wide-ranging command of a vast repertoire. A dedicated educator\, she’s led a Gypsy jazz combo\, created historically rooted shows focusing on the early music of the Nat “King” Cole Trio\, Ella Fitzgerald\, and Edith Piaf\, and worked with many of the Bay Area’s finest improvisers.Stella Heath has many stories to tell. Since emerging on the Bay Area jazz scene in 2014\, she’s become one of the busiest and most consistently captivating vocalists in the region. Her debut album\, For Billie\, flows out of one of her signature endeavors\, The Billie Holiday Project.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/stella-heath-billie-holiday-to-edith-piaf-special-saturday-sunset-series-show/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Stella-Heath-Resized-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
