SUMMARY:LAURIE LEWIS 7/17/2026 Sunset Series
DESCRIPTION:OUTDOOR SUNSET SERIES with LAURIE LEWIS\n\nFor nearly four decades\, Laurie Lewis has gathered fans and honors for her powerful and emotive voice and her versatile\, dynamic songwriting. She is a sought-after recording producer and an equally skilled teacher and mentor.\nShe has shown us how to lead bands of talented musicians – learning from them while helping them make their best music.  And she has shown us how to thrive in a constantly changing musical environment – without ever sacrificing her art.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/laurie-lewis-7-17-2026-sunset-series/
