SUMMARY:DAVE ALVIN & JIMMIE DALE GILMORE - Almost Acoustic Duo
DESCRIPTION:BBQ on the Lawn with DAVE ALVIN & JIMMIE DALE GILMORE – Almost Acoustic Duo\nWhen Grammy winner Dave Alvin and Grammy nominee Jimmie Dale Gilmore made the album Downey To Lubbock together in 2018\, they wrote the title track as a sort of mission statement. “I know someday this old highway’s gonna come to an end\,” Alvin sings near the song’s conclusion. Gilmore answers: “But I know when it does you’re going to be my friend.”
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/dave-alvin-jimmie-dale-gilmore-almost-acoustic-duo-2/
