SUMMARY:SOUL SKA + special guests Beso Negro
DESCRIPTION:BBQ on the Lawn with SOUL SKA + special guests BESO NEGRO \nThe Bay Area’s premiere Ska/rocksteady collective has been packin’ houses and rockin’ dancehalls since 2014. The 8 piece band is comprised of veteran members of legendary NorCal bands such as Vinyl\, Stymie & the Pimp Jones Love Orchestra\, The Right Time\, Albino!\, El Radio Fantastique\, Jethro Jeremiah Band + more. Drawing equally from the Jamaican 1st wave as well as the UK 2nd wave the band’s rootsy\, upbeat sound leans heavily on vocal harmonies and a full horn section. Soul Ska has become a Northern California festival and nightclub favorite.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/soul-ska-special-guests-beso-negro-2/
