SUMMARY:CRYING UNCLE BLUEGRASS BAND ~ Sunset Series
DESCRIPTION:Sunset Series with CRYING UNCLE BLUEGRASS BAND  \nCrying Uncle Bluegrass (CUBG) \nWidely recognized as one of the most exciting young bands in acoustic music\, Crying Uncle Bluegrass Band plays a unique mix of bluegrass\, Dawg (David Grisman music)\, jazz\, and modern originals. Brothers Miles and Teo Quale are joined by bassist Andrew Osborn and 2023 National Flat Pick Guitar Champion Ian Ly\, all outstanding musicians of the vibrant California bluegrass scene. Founded in 2016 as a Duo band\, Miles and Teo formed the bluegrass band in 2017 and since then\, they have continued to make waves in the world of bluegrass and acoustic music. In 2024\, the bluegrass band celebrated their debut at the Grand Ole Opry; and in 2023\, they received the International Bluegrass Music Association’s Momentum Band of the Year award. The band was also honored to perform for the Bluegrass Music Hall of Fame’s induction of their hero\, David Grisman.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/crying-uncle-bluegrass-band-sunset-series/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Crying-Uncle-resized.jpg
END:VEVENT
